{"id":"2b6db6d3eb5ef594","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-easton-forcing.md","title":"Easton Forcing","display":"thm-easton-forcing — Easton Forcing","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-easton-forcing","aliases":["58-thm-easton-forcing","Easton Forcing","Easton Theorem","Easton Cardinal Arithmetic"],"display":"thm-easton-forcing — Easton Forcing","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch19/58-thm-iterated-forcing.md]]","[[../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-easton-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-easton-forcing</span><span>Easton Forcing</span><span>Easton Theorem</span><span>Easton Cardinal Arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-easton-forcing — Easton Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e365137dcbb1ce1\" href=\"?note=6e365137dcbb1ce1\" title=\"../batch19/58-thm-iterated-forcing.md\">../batch19/58-thm-iterated-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e4b11a70b933099\" href=\"?note=5e4b11a70b933099\" title=\"../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md\">../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegCard}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegCard}\\)</span> (class of infinite regular cardinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (class function on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegCard}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegCard}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (ZFC axiom system)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> (consistency predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}easton\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\kappa))\\land\n\\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(F(\\kappa)\\leq F(\\lambda)\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}+\n\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(2^\\kappa=F(\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}easton\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\kappa))\\land\n\\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(F(\\kappa)\\leq F(\\lambda)\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}+\n\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(2^\\kappa=F(\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Easton (1970): proved the theorem.</li>\n<li>Product forcing with Easton support: key innovation.</li>\n<li>Regular cardinals: freely controllable (within König constraint).</li>\n<li>The displayed antecedent states the two Easton constraints explicitly: monotonicity and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(F(\\kappa))&gt;\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(F(\\kappa))&gt;\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Easton's theorem does not decide the singular-cardinal behavior of the continuum function.</li>\n<li>Singular cardinals: different behavior (Silver, SCH).</li>\n<li>The theorem controls only infinite regular cardinals; singular-cardinal behavior requires different methods and often additional hypotheses.</li>\n<li>The assertion is a relative-consistency metatheorem over a class function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>; it is not an internal ZFC quantification over a set of all regular cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-thm-iterated-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e365137dcbb1ce1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-thm-iterated-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e4b11a70b933099","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-konig-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}$ (cofinality function, see [[58-df-cofinality]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegCard}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegCard}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}easton\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\;\n\\bigl(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\kappa))\\land\n\\kappa<\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa))\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\forall\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(F(\\kappa)\\leq F(\\lambda)\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZFC}+\n\\forall\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{RegCard}\\;\n\\bigl(2^\\kappa=F(\\kappa)\\bigr)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(F(\\kappa))>\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":2212,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-easton-forcing.md|58-thm-easton-forcing]]（batch13）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection-proper.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection.md]]\n[[58-thm-coanalytic-separation.md]]\n[[58-thm-coding-universe.md]]\n[[58-thm-cofinality-regular.md]]\n[[58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH.md]]\n[[58-thm-collapse-forcing.md]]\n[[58-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[58-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[58-thm-countable-choice.md]]\n[[58-thm-covering-lemma.md]]\